.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Run outputs. CarDetection/.gitignore lacks an equivalent rule and has had run
# artifacts committed by accident twice (PROGRESS.md gap 8) — this is that lesson,
# applied up front rather than after the fact.
outputs/
*.jpg
*.png

# PyInstaller output from build_worker.sh. Multiple GB — the same lesson again,
# ahead of the first build rather than after someone commits one.
build/
dist/

# Note what is deliberately NOT ignored: *.pt. models/server_trained.pt is
# tracked on purpose (19.2 MB, locally fine-tuned, no public URL to download it
# from) and the worker hard-errors without it.
